{"name":"Trout Pout","hex":"#cb7077","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"trout pout","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The exaggerated, grotesque result of injection of excessive quantities of collagen into the lips in order to make them appear fuller."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/trout_pout"}],"entries":[{"title":"Lip augmentation","blocks":[{"text":"Lip augmentation is a cosmetic procedure that modifies the shape of the lips using fillers, such as collagen or implants. The procedure may be performed to increase lip size, correct asymmetry, create protrusion, or adjust the ratio of the top and bottom lips. The procedure typically involves surgical injection, though temporary non-surgical alternatives exist."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cd/Pooladkaf_Ski_Resort_Sepidan%2C_Iran_%284%29.jpg/330px-Pooladkaf_Ski_Resort_Sepidan%2C_Iran_%284%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lip_augmentation","wikidata":"Q6556145"},{"title":"Trout","blocks":[{"text":"Trout is a generic common name for numerous species of carnivorous freshwater fishes belonging to the genera Oncorhynchus, Salmo, and Salvelinus, all of which are members of the subfamily Salmoninae in the family Salmonidae. The word trout is also used for some similar-shaped but non-salmonid fish, such as the spotted seatrout/speckled trout."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2e/Salmo_trutta.jpg/330px-Salmo_trutta.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Trout","wikidata":"Q2258881"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f9/Marble_trout_from_zadla%C5%A1%C4%8Dica.jpg/500px-Marble_trout_from_zadla%C5%A1%C4%8Dica.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia